  "body": "- [x] Diagnose root causes of 12 console errors on /compliance page\n- [x] Fix `useComplianceBreachObservations` hook: replace 4 stale FK constraint hints (`vehicle_observations_v2_zone_id_fkey`) with correct `zones(name)` / `organizations(name)` — eliminates 4 failed PostgREST network requests per Breaches tab load\n- [x] Fix `useComplianceBreachObservations` hook: map `id: row.observation_id` (non-null PK) instead of nullable `row.id` — eliminates React duplicate-key warnings from null keys\n- [x] Reduce from 8 sequential fallback queries to 2 (join attempt + plain fallback) for improved performance\n- [x] Lint passes (`bun run lint`)\n- [x] Build passes (`bun run build`)",
